WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Download and run the installer. This demo uses an isolated folder;
Node, tmux, and signed-in Claude Code are already installed.

00:05.500 --> 00:08.000
Refresh the available Claude models once.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.500
Launch bohselecta popup claude --model opus.
Opus demonstrates a switch; Sonnet is the default.

00:10.500 --> 00:19.000
A real Ratatui popup compares Sonnet and Opus.
Use arrow keys to choose Sonnet, then press Enter.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Claude shows its hook notice. Bohselecta submits
the saved task's Sonnet continuation command.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
Claude answers in the same conversation.
This recorded task ran on Sonnet.
